ou a confirmation email.\"},{\"type\":\"tool_call\",\"id\":\"call_053690133edd555197789f13c7c87a34\",\"name\":\"notify_customer\",\"arguments\":{\"order_id\":\"NW-1042\",\"email\":\"ana.ruiz@example.com\",\"summary\":\"Your order NW-1042 arrived damaged, so we've issued a full refund of €49.90 to your original payment method — no return needed.\"}}]},{\"role\":\"user\",\"parts\":[{\"type\":\"tool_call_response\",\"id\":\"call_053690133edd555197789f13c7c87a34\",\"response\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"{\\\"message_id\\\":\\\"msg_ee6909fd8f\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"sent\\\"}\"}]}]}]",
    "gen_ai.output.messages": "[{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"parts\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"content\":\"All set, Ana! I've issued a full refund of €49.90 for order NW-1042 back to your original payment method, and the refund is already settled. You don't need to return the damaged tablet, and a confirmation email is on its way to you. Sorry again for the inconvenience — is there anything else I can help with?\"}]}]",
